Swing doors, huh?

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.260
Okay, doors.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.060
Let's wake up.

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:06.600
How do I get the slilly bars on the window?

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:09.620
One, two, three, slilly.

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:52.000
of poetry.

00:01:53.190 --> 00:01:53.710
That'll work.

00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:58.350
slumber and shroud me in thy purple cloak.

00:01:59.080 --> 00:01:59.180
Thank you.

00:01:59.690 --> 00:01:59.950
his name.

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:00.360
rhyme.

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:03.410
Is that my tea's made?

00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:06.800
I can't stand it.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.880
U-U-U-U-U-U-U-U-U-U-U-U-U.
